BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:quin-event-197304@thequinhouse.com
DTSTAMP:20260811T200000Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260811T200000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260811T210000
SUMMARY:Rooftop Rendezvous: Citadelle Gin
LOCATION:The Sky Deck
DESCRIPTION:Category: Food & Beverage\nPrice: Free / Included\nStatus: unli
 mited\nEvent URL: https://members.thequinhouse.com/events/197304\n\nThis A
 ugust\, we invite you to discover a month-long celebration of exceptional 
 cocktails in partnership with Citadelle Gin\, the acclaimed French gin ren
 owned for its balance\, elegance\, and craftsmanship.\n\nTo celebrate the 
 collaboration\, join us for a celebratory rooftop rendezvous featuring two
  signature serves available throughout the month: the impeccably chilled F
 reezer Door Martini and the timeless French 75. Each cocktail showcases Ci
 tadelle Gin's distinctive botanical character while offering a refined int
 erpretation of two enduring classics\, complemented by premium caviar from
  Caviar Nantucket\, served atop perfectly crisp potato chips for a timeles
 s pairing.\n\nSip an ice-cold cocktail as the sun sets over the Boston sky
 line\, indulge in an elegant pairing of gin and caviar\, and savor the sea
 son from one of The 'Quin's most spectacular vantage points.\n\n*This even
 t is complimentary and reserved for members only.
URL:https://members.thequinhouse.com/events/197304
CATEGORIES:Food & Beverage
END:VEVENT
