DESCRIPTION:Category: Member Mixer\nPrice: Free / Included\nStatus: unlimit
 ed\nEvent URL: https://members.thequinhouse.com/events/197999\n\nJoin fell
 ow members for an early summer evening at Night Shift Brewery on the Espla
 nade\, a lively outdoor beer garden set along the Charles River.\n\nThis c
 asual gathering offers an easy setting to connect\, unwind\, and enjoy a c
 urated selection of beers\, hard seltzers\, wines\, and non-alcoholic opti
 ons. Whether catching up with familiar faces or meeting someone new\, the 
 atmosphere is designed to be social\, welcoming\, and effortlessly enjoyab
 le.\n\nDogs are welcome so feel free to bring your four-legged companion a
 long for the evening.\n\n*This event is complimentary and reserved for mem
 bers only. Each member will receive two complimentary drinks\, followed by
  a cash bar. Food will be available for purchase.
